      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Omar asked his sister, who studies computing, whether this permission was necessary. She explained that an algorithm could use several small details to build a profile. She did not claim that every app was dangerous. Instead, she encouraged him to check the purpose of each request and the company's privacy policy.",
