      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The company said that it stored information securely. Omar wanted to know how long the records would be retained and whether users could delete them. Strong encryption might reduce some risks, but it would not explain why unnecessary information was collected. A security claim needed evidence, not just an attractive label.",
